{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-product-operator","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0170","math_ordinal":151,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The functions live on different factor spaces and 253B defines their tensor product; ordinary pointwise multiplication is undefined here. The following convergence and integral identities also use the tensor product.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt253.tex:180","source_normalized_sha256":"b9ba06eb9beeea72d9285a0668d7c9a7f0bdb21a9e6889761339c8607540ca0e","source_text":"\\sequencen{f_n\\times g_n}","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt253.tex:180","target_normalized_sha256":"a70bcf101db70db716a037fdc6ad6f2b7386dfca29a5df80e64b828bc0d1e38c","target_text":"\\sequencen{f_n\\otimes g_n}","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S253"}
{"classification":"mathematical-undefined-set-symbol","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0171","math_ordinal":285,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The construction defines F'_j immediately above; bare F_j is not the constructed family and conflicts with both the decomposition and the right-hand side of this equality.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt253.tex:353","source_normalized_sha256":"9231cb5410187ee5975ce2ac6024e02141e6b529d1243c04d132c0fbebbcd5ec","source_text":"G_j\\times F_j","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt253.tex:353","target_normalized_sha256":"b5fa8bc142b53f8d8f7a7cba0c3dcb1ea76c57a5ab89b7a736f79c2eb946627d","target_text":"G_j\\times F'_j","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S253"}
{"classification":"mathematical-missing-index","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0172","math_ordinal":451,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The simple-function level sets in this indexed sum are H_i; no unindexed H belongs to the estimate.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt253.tex:524-525","source_normalized_sha256":"0a320157ff795a3254ccd98212b1f5a6549f065e25090c325a6d1028b03805bb","source_text":"H\\symmdiff\\bigcup_{j\\le m_i}G_{ij}\\times F_{ij}","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt253.tex:525-526","target_normalized_sha256":"fdf4ecb21f7c4c5e5151e42e3f07acda79f781983d8c96f1437dfc49b6a729d3","target_text":"H_i\\symmdiff\\bigcup_{j\\le m_i}G_{ij}\\times F_{ij}","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S253"}
{"classification":"mathematical-wrong-factor-set-symbol","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0173","math_ordinal":708,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The selected rectangle is E times H with H in the second-factor sigma-algebra; F is undefined in this argument.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt253.tex:755-756","source_normalized_sha256":"e1312349dc9560095b1400d7cad9d8e38409fd6b991b385b0e2de333c830761e","source_text":"\\nu F","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt253.tex:756-757","target_normalized_sha256":"4ec49b05c0222adf7154864c48a8d70d38f2d2d84fc724641db90015857875fb","target_text":"\\nu H","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S253"}
{"classification":"mathematical-missing-codomain-norm","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0174","math_ordinal":882,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The multilinear operator is W-valued and a general Banach space has no scalar supremum of its vectors. Taking the W norm is the multilinear analogue of the bounded bilinear norm defined in 253Ab.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt253.tex:966-967","source_normalized_sha256":"b9aa8af59579096a4b7ec2046bdd49922f7eada2cc2c7744091035c13484cf85","source_text":"\\sup\\{\\phi(u_1,\\ldots,u_n):\\|u_i\\|_1\\le1\\Forall i\\le n\\}","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt253.tex:978-979","target_normalized_sha256":"e35bec6583cf388b42d90c84081f8e14e77ea5f311e3e4a940c7e8a7815e43d1","target_text":"\\sup\\{\\|\\phi(u_1,\\ldots,u_n)\\|:\\|u_i\\|_1\\le1\\Forall i\\le n\\}","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S253"}
{"classification":"mathematical-codomain-type-error","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0175","math_ordinal":1074,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The Bochner integral of the map into L^1(nu) must itself be an L^1(nu) class, whereas the printed integral is scalar. The derivative identifies the class g^bullet and retains the intended scalar Fubini consequence. Target-only atoms 1074 and 1075 and the aligned scalar identity at 1074 are hash-bound in the unit QA.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt253.tex:1130-1133","source_normalized_sha256":"46ecc82803c5044f14e883e76ae75080be17dc6b3937c58a5b40b8d6137bd63e","source_text":"the Bochner integral is \\int f d\\lambda_0","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt253.tex:1154-1159","target_normalized_sha256":"482a07ef206209345032b50aa6be31256bef8de914cf877f06221dcfd731cf0a","target_text":"integral Bochner-nya adalah g^bullet dengan g(y)=\\int f(x,y)\\mu(dx); khususnya \\int g d\\nu=\\int f d\\lambda_0","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S253"}
{"classification":"source-dependency-metadata-error","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0176","provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The dependency comment on 253Yi self-references Yi. Section 253Yg supplies the forward section map and 253Yh supplies the jointly measurable representative required for the reverse direction.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt253.tex:1151","source_text":"%253Yg, 253Yi, 253+","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt253.tex:1179","target_text":"%253Yg, 253Yh, 253+","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S253"}
{"classification":"mathematical-missing-positivity-hypothesis","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0177","provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-CH25-COMPLETE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"Without positivity of u the condition would force the linear operator T to vanish and is not equivalent to positivity of the multilinear map. The added hypothesis matches 253G(c); target insertion ordinal 1136 is hash-bound in unit QA.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt2.2016/mt253.tex:1175-1178","source_text":"Tu\\ge0 whenever u\\in L^1(\\lambda)","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt253.tex:1207-1211","target_normalized_sha256":"8a4316f560fc390b9a600e5415d9ca5598a0e249d941c0b08349b20269816764","target_text":"Tu\\ge0 kapan pun u\\in L^1(\\lambda) dan u\\ge0","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S253"}
